        "created_at": "2016-12-20T02:11:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I won't say it was&nbsp;<em>easy</em>, but I did Mint without knowing what I was getting into. It went by so fast, I can't even comment on what I did (just Block as much as possible!), save for Risking into&nbsp;<em>two</em> Karmic Retributions without the requisite pool. D:</p>",
