        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-12-20T02:13:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Not too rough--Young Legacy and Setback's HP quickly goes down to match that of the Sentinels, but then it got under control.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Proletariat pretty much took care of himself, with all the clones out (I figure the title of the One-shot pretty much gives that spoiler away ;) )</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Oddly, the Idealist ended at full HP, Writhe was at 5HP, and everyone else was at 9 or 10.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:13:07.400Z",
