        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-12-20T15:31:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Pretty much as everyone else said.&nbsp; not easy, but not difficult, either.&nbsp; But certainly fun.</p><p>It staterd off painful, and I don't remember whether I wasted Blade or Fright Train first (I think Blade, to get rid of the Nemeses he had out), but it was considerably easier after the HP of all the heroes equalized.</p>",
