      {
        "id": 187343,
        "name": "fanaka66",
        "username": "fanaka66",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fanaka66/{size}/2458_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-12-21T00:46:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>#1. I'm loving Vengeance. I haven't had much of a chance to play team villains much IRL. Really loving the format in the video game and now I can't wait for Villains!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>#2. I think I made this much more difficult than I should have. &nbsp;Proletariat was killing himself until he got down to 2hp. Then Legacy's Landing Pad came out and saved him. He then absorbed all his clones and gained a bunch of hp. &nbsp;Then he played a card that gave him +6 damage.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Setback got rid of Blade's physique and he was the first to fall. I then concentrated on pumped up proletariat and finally Fright Train. Lots of blocking and Setback died once (luckily there was a silver lining). Ended up mint but it took a while.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:13:07.665Z",
